        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\$15\\,000$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}I&=PRT\\\\4320&=P\\times0.048\\times6\\\\4320&=0.288P\\\\P&=\\frac{4320}{0.288}\\\\P&=\\$15\\,000\\end{align*}$$",
